 * the route, about 95 road miles from Seminole.
 *
 * VERIFIED facts used here:
 *  - Code structure: Big Spring Code ch. 36 "Nuisances". Article I is
 *    "PROPERTY MAINTENANCE" (title amended by Ord. 003-2022, 25 Jan 2022).
 *    Article III is "VECTOR CONTROL" and includes sec. 36-61, "General
 *    prohibition against rat harborage". Article IV covers junked motor
 *    vehicles (sec. 36-118 notice/rehearing). Ch. 36 carries state-law
 *    references to Tex. Local Gov't Code §217.042 and Tex. Health & Safety
 *    Code ch. 344. There is a SEPARATE Structural Standards and Nuisance
 *    Abatement Ordinance, amended in its entirety by Ord. 023-2023
 *    (28 Mar 2023), which defines SEPROs — "Sanitation and Exterior
